  "overview": "Akaza is the strongest Demon character in the game and the only Demon who uses a Breathing-style attack format (martial arts strikes instead of weapon-based Blood Demon Art). His Destructive Death (破壊殺) techniques operate like Skill Attacks but hit at closer range and deal higher base damage than most swordsmen. Mark of Destruction (his Skill 3 counter) is the longest-range counterattack in the game, outdistancing even Giyu's Dead Calm in horizontal reach. Akaza cannot regenerate HP via Breathing but regenerates passively (1 HP/second) as his Blood Demon Art passive, the only passive regeneration in the roster.",
  "overviewJa": "猗窩座はゲーム内最強の鬼キャラクターで、呼吸法スタイルの攻撃形式（武器ベースの血鬼術の代わりに武術打撃）を使う唯一の鬼。破壊殺技は技攻撃のように機能するが近距離でヒットし大半の剣士より高い基本ダメージを与える。破壊殺の型（技3カウンター）はゲーム最長射程のカウンターアタックで、義勇の凪の水平リーチも凌ぐ。猗窩座は呼吸でHP再生できないが、血鬼術パッシブで受動的に再生する（毎秒1HP）—ロスター唯一のパッシブ再生。",
